%% Source: docs-src/cancellation-and-timeouts.md

flowchart TD
    A([Request sent]) --> B{timeout elapsed?}
    B -- yes --> T([Throw TIMEOUT_ERROR]):::err
    B -- no --> C{AbortSignal aborted?}
    C -- yes --> AB([Throw ABORTED_ERROR]):::err
    C -- no --> D{Response received?}
    D -- no --> B
    D -- yes --> E([Return result]):::ok

    F([In retry wait]) --> G{AbortSignal aborted?}
    G -- yes --> AB
    G -- no --> H[Continue waiting]
    H --> F

    classDef ok fill:#d5e8d4,stroke:#82b366,color:#2d5016;
    classDef err fill:#f8cecc,stroke:#b85450,color:#5c1a1a;